{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EJzv0LQg4Q1795246307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[15:15更新]</p><p>秘魯中部發生6.7地震，首都利馬有強烈震感，暫時未有傷亡報告。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PERU.QUAKE-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JtEJ0TUUtX1795246318.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國地質勘探局指，事發在秘魯時間周五晚上7時09分，震央位於卡爾瓦馬約區，震源深度108公里。新華社引述秘魯地球物理研究所測定，指首都利馬等震感強烈。</p><p></p><p>[08:32] </p><p>秘魯發生6.7級地震，首都利馬震感強烈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:03:52.871240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:16.394066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:16.394066+00:00","content_hash":"34197eac7b64b76ba1a963ed73eb824ffd907bf6202963c997b335084e9e3fb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}